---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<section class="section-shell contact-section" id="contact">
  <div class="section-header" data-reveal="up">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">CONTACT_PROTOCOL</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Reach out if the role needs product sense and build range.</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        I am open to frontend or full-stack roles, collaborative builds, and conversations where
        engineering taste matters as much as the checklist.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="section-rule"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-grid">
    <article class="terminal-panel contact-card" data-reveal="left">
      <div class="panel-header">
        <span>OUTBOUND // READY</span>
        <span>24H WINDOW</span>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-card__body">
        <p>
          The fastest route is email. If you want a quick overview first, LinkedIn and GitHub cover
          the current build history and background.
        </p>

        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="cta-primary" href="mailto:tharunbalaji110@gmail.com">SEND_MAIL</a>
          <a
            class="cta-secondary"
            href="https://github.com/Tharun-Balaji"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            target="_blank"
          >
            GITHUB_LOGS
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="terminal-panel contact-card" data-reveal="right">
      <div class="panel-header">
        <span>CHANNELS // 003</span>
        <span>VERIFIED</span>
      </div>

      <ul class="contact-links">
        <li>
          <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:tharunbalaji110@gmail.com">
            <span>EMAIL</span>
            <strong>tharunbalaji110@gmail.com</strong>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            class="contact-link"
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tharun-balaji-j-a65402260/"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            target="_blank"
          >
            <span>LINKEDIN</span>
            <strong>tharun-balaji-j-a65402260</strong>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            class="contact-link"
            href="https://github.com/Tharun-Balaji"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            target="_blank"
          >
            <span>GITHUB</span>
            <strong>github.com/Tharun-Balaji</strong>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>

  <p class="contact-footnote" data-reveal="up">
    © {currentYear} Tharun Balaji // built with Astro and a systems-first portfolio direction
  </p>
</section>
